; Winning route for Message From Andromeda.
; Primary source: Classic Adventures Solution Archive lists the
; solution as by Dorothy (https://solutionarchive.com/game/id,353/);
; command list from the CASA complete solution mirrored on The Tipshop.
; Not playthrough-verified.

[Solution:overview:Overview]

Land on the planet, recover what you need from the alien complex, and
take off again in your ship.

Source: Classic Adventures Solution Archive / Tipshop complete
solution (CASA game page https://solutionarchive.com/game/id,353/
credits Dorothy; the .rtf solution file requires login).

#LIST
{ Wear gloves before handling the fungus }
{ Published tips cover the rod/plate and sphere puzzles }
LIST#

[Solution:notes-tips:Published Tips]

Crash/YS tips mirrored on Tipshop: POINT ROD AT PLATE to open the
panel; move and rotate the sphere between pedestals/dish; READ MESSAGE
/ LAND / OPEN AIRLOCK / LEAVE to begin. Cut ropes for the skeleton /
missile chain; wear gloves to get fungus for the slug.

